    "comments": [],
    "html": "\n<p>这段文字来自古登堡段落区块。<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"ref_1_1\"><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"#ref_1\">[1]</a></sup> <sup class=\"reference\" id=\"ref_1_2\"><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"#ref_1\">[1]</a></sup></p>\n\n<h2 id=\"折叠\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">折叠</h2>\n\n<div class=\"collapse-block collapse-block-transparent shadow-sm collapsed\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"collapse-block-title\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"collapse-block-title-inner\">构建期折叠</span><i class=\"collapse-icon fa fa-angle-down\"></i></button><div class=\"collapse-block-body\" hidden>这里的短代码在构建时展开。</div></div>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"/argon/donate.svg\" alt=\"打赏\"></figure><p class=\"wp-block-rss\"><a href=\"/feed.xml\">RSS</a></p><table class=\"wp-block-calendar\"><caption>2026-11</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Sun</th><th scope=\"col\">Mon</th><th scope=\"col\">Tue</th><th scope=\"col\">Wed</th><th scope=\"col\">Thu</th><th scope=\"col\">Fri</th><th scope=\"col\">Sat</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>2</td><td>3</td><td>4</td><td>5</td><td>6</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>9</td><td>10</td><td>11</td><td>12</td><td>13</td><td>14</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>16</td><td>17</td><td>18</td><td>19</td><td>20</td><td>21</td></tr><tr><td>22</td><td>23</td><td>24</td><td>25</td><td>26</td><td>27</td><td>28</td></tr><tr><td>29</td><td>30</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table><ul class=\"wp-block-latest-posts\"><li><a href=\"/posts/gutenberg/\">古登堡示例</a></li><li><a href=\"/posts/hello-argon/\">你好，Argon</a></li></ul><ul class=\"wp-block-latest-posts\"><li><a href=\"/posts/gutenberg/\">古登堡示例</a></li><li><a href=\"/posts/hello-argon/\">你好，Argon</a></li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"无头构建与静态渲染流程\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">无头构建与静态渲染流程</h2>\n\n<p>在 WordPress 无头模式下，所有古登堡区块、Argon 短代码、文章分类、标签、说说与同源媒体资源都会在构建阶段同步到 Astro 并编译为纯静态 HTML，部署到 Serverless 平台后浏览器不再向 WordPress 后台发起任何请求。</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"代码块与多主题高亮\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">代码块与多主题高亮</h3>\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-\">export async function buildSite(source: \"local\" | \"wordpress\") {\n  const entries = await loadContent(source);\n  return renderStaticRoutes(entries);\n}\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"提示框与引用排版\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">提示框与引用排版</h3>\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><p>静态站点同样保留完整的 Argon 动效、侧栏文章目录、右下角阅读进度指示器与深浅色主题无缝切换。</p></blockquote>\n\n<p>当文章正文高度超过一屏时，向下滚动阅读即可在右下角浮动按钮底部看到原版「阅读进度」百分比按钮与内部填充条，同时左侧栏文章目录也会随滚动自动高亮当前章节。</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"评论与扩展能力\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">评论与扩展能力</h2>\n\n<p>评论系统支持在构建配置中自由切换第三方评论（Giscus / Waline / Twikoo / Artalk）或通过私有签名接口对接 WordPress 原生评论，并完整支持表情键盘、Markdown、悄悄话与评论点赞。</p>\n<div class=\"reference-list-container\"><h3>参考</h3><ol class=\"reference-list\"><li id=\"ref_1\"><span class=\"reference-list-backlink\">^</span><sup><a class=\"reference-list-backlink\" href=\"#ref_1_1\">a</a></sup><sup><a class=\"reference-list-backlink\" href=\"#ref_1_2\">b</a></sup><span>本地参考，不含 CMS 地址</span></li></ol></div>"
  },
  {
